1
00:00:08,070 --> 00:00:10,570
(Raj:)Oh, Bella, don't you see?

2
00:00:10,570 --> 00:00:14,340
(Raj:)Edward's only pushing you away
because he loves you.

3
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:16,510
(Raj:)Coming.

4
00:00:21,350 --> 00:00:23,150
(Woman at Door:)Dr. Koothrappali?

5
00:00:25,270 --> 00:00:27,860
(Woman at Door:)I'm Special Agent Page, FBI.

6
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:29,020
(Woman at Door:)May I come in?

7
00:00:30,810 --> 00:00:34,730
(Woman at Door:)I'd like to talk to you
about Howard Wolowitz.

8
00:00:34,730 --> 00:00:36,230
(Woman at Door:)Oh, thank you.

9
00:00:36,230 --> 00:00:37,320
(Woman at Door:)All right.

10
00:00:37,320 --> 00:01:01,020
(Woman at Door:)Well, how long
have you known Mr. Wolowitz?

